/* --- the calendar leads ---------------------------------------------------
 *
 * plan.css draws a schedule block as one flat link: a stripe, a name, an hour.
 * Here an hour is a stack — the shows that wanted it, behind the one that took
 * it — and the card in front carries only the show, plus a mark when the
 * reader has locked it. Everything the page has to say about that card is in
 * the popup, so a calendar at rest reads as a calendar.
 */
.sch-slot { position: absolute; left: 3px; right: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
